    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Differentiate on both side w.r.t&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now finding critical point we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now differentiating equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;to check maxima and minima we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, so it will give point of&nbsp; minima,</p><p>Now minimum value will be given by,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>e</mi></msqrt></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
